                  "name": "Desk Note Body",
                  "fill": "#263140",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Most days I am chasing a queue that should have drained an hour ago, or watching Athena turn a messy log lake into something a human can query. I like that kind of problem.",
